{"parse": {"title": "最初的刻度", "pageid": 93488, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"cloth-info\"><div class=\"cloth-info--img\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"最初的刻度\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d9/Cloth-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"最初的刻度\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"cloth-info--txt\"><div class=\"serif\"><div style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:0.9;\">最初的刻度</div><div class=\"grey-small\">FIRST MELODY</div></div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"color:grey\">它是开始，或是终结，是想象穷极的一切可能。</div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">司辰的激情 | <span class=\"grey-small\">MOXIE</span></div><hr style=\"margin:5px 0\" /><div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">使用神秘术</span><div style=\"float:right\">+4</div></div><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">移动神秘术</span><div style=\"float:right\">+3</div></div><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">融合神秘术</span><div style=\"float:right\">+2</div></div><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">回合恢复</span><div style=\"float:right\">+5</div></div><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">初始激情</span><div style=\"float:right\">+15</div></div></div><div style=\"color:#D4612B; margin-top:6px\">司辰的初始激情提高；回合开始时稳定获得激情</div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">咒语 | <span class=\"grey-small\">INCANTATION</span></div><hr style=\"margin:5px 0\" /><div><div><img alt=\"Cancost1 glow.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/22px-Cancost1_glow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/33px-Cancost1_glow.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/44px-Cancost1_glow.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /><span class=\"grey-small\">Cost: 40 → 50 → 60</span><div>生成一张特殊咒语，该咒语可以与任何<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>阶咒语融合升阶。</div></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Cancost2 glow.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cancost2_glow.png/22px-Cancost2_glow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cancost2_glow.png/33px-Cancost2_glow.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cancost2_glow.png/44px-Cancost2_glow.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><span class=\"grey-small\">Cost: 25</span><div>保留当前所有咒语的阶次，并将它们随机改变为新的咒语。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">最初的刻度 <small style=\"color: grey\">FIRST MELODY</small></span></span>"}}